From acf6469f7452fcbff58c44b84dd38aa9563721fe Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Cursor Agent <cursoragent@cursor.com>
Date: Mon, 24 Aug 2026 13:26:25 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 20/23] feat(web): console-managed WeChat QR login config for
 challenge #11

Add a mall-console WeChat OAuth panel mirroring the national-identity
pattern: secrets stored under /etc/matchplane/secrets, a rootSuperAdmin
GET/PATCH route, and wiring into configuredOAuthProviders(). Pre-fills
the official Open Platform qrconnect/sns endpoints and adapts generic
OAuth to WeChat's native protocol (appid/secret GET token exchange,
errcode bodies, openid userinfo parameter, no PKCE) while keeping the
standard flow for proxy or mock gateways.
